WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.080
A good timeline makes it easy to see what happened, when it happened and where the record comes from.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.160
Date. Start with what the source can date.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.720
Source. Open the record attached to the event.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.800
Status. Check what changed and when the page was reviewed.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.640
How It Unfolded links the dated events it lists to records readers can check.
